# One player drives a single race on track 0 with the gas held and the steering at full lock, left and right, as a
# key steers (a key is full tilt: input.stick_range): taps, whole seconds, and locks of three and four seconds that
# turn the car round and into the track's side at speed. The player report of docs/port/QA.md "Player reports" 1 (the
# car exploded when steered) on the synthetic cartridge, whose trace CI compares between the Windows program and
# Linux's (docs/port/WINDOWS.md 12).
# until: 0x400000:1350
# seconds: 100
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 45        # gas for 45 s
30 STICKRIGHT 1
31 STICKLEFT 1
32 STICKRIGHT 1
33 STICKLEFT 1
34 STICKRIGHT 0.5
34.5 STICKLEFT 0.5
35 STICKRIGHT 2
37 STICKLEFT 2
40 STICKRIGHT 3
44 STICKLEFT 4
49 STICKRIGHT 0.2
49.4 STICKLEFT 0.2
49.8 STICKRIGHT 0.2
50.2 STICKLEFT 0.2
52 STICKRIGHT 6
59 STICKLEFT 6
66 STICKRIGHT 1.5
68 STICKLEFT 1.5
